"                    <p> Dear <t t-out=\"object.employee_id.name or ''\"/>,</p>\n"
"                    <p>Please find the attached payslip of the period: <t t-out=\"object.date_from\"/> - <t t-out=\"object.date_to\"/></p>\n"
